# Optional. kodo's primary config is `kodo.toml` (see kodo.toml.example or run
# `kodo init`). You normally do NOT need a .env.
#
# Use this only for per-machine overrides of kodo.toml, or for secrets you'd
# rather keep out of a committed file. A KODO_* env var (including one set here)
# overrides kodo.toml's top-level keys.

# Override the library location for this machine (e.g. a different mount on Linux).
# KODO_LIBRARY_ROOT=/mnt/llm/Library

# Hugging Face token for gated/private repos (falls back to `hf login`).
# KODO_HF_TOKEN=hf_...
